ory\">As of Oct 12, October to November is the driest pair on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, and it came in under 90% of normal in 37 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025 that pair ran 37% of normal on the middle, and November to December ran 32%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 26% of normal on the middle. On grid 18198 the driest year was 2007 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
